#: ../../site/api/core.md:1
msgid "Core types and errors"
msgstr "核心类型与错误"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:3
msgid ""
"Frames, timestamps, calendars, operation descriptors, versions, rolling "
"windows, data-provider contracts and structured errors."
msgstr "帧、时间戳、日历、操作描述符、版本、滚动窗口、数据提供方约定和结构化错误。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:5
msgid ""
"See the [usage guide](../quickstart.md) for task-oriented examples. "
"Signatures below are generated from the public headers at the same commit as"
" the rest of this site."
msgstr "面向任务的使用示例请参阅[使用指南](../quickstart.md)。以下签名与本站其余内容在同一提交中由公共头文件生成。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid "Lazy, value-owning container for first-phase performance analytics."
msgstr "用于第一阶段绩效分析的惰性、持有数值的容器。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid ""
"summary() returns these stable keys: Annual return, Cumulative returns, "
"Annual volatility, Sharpe ratio, Sortino ratio, Calmar ratio, Max drawdown, "
"Historical value at risk, Conditional value at risk, and, when supplied a "
"benchmark, Alpha and Beta."
msgstr ""
"summary() 返回以下稳定键：Annual return、Cumulative returns、Annual volatility、Sharpe "
"ratio、Sortino ratio、Calmar ratio、Max drawdown、Historical value at "
"risk、Conditional value at risk，以及在提供基准时返回 Alpha 和 Beta。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7 ../../site/api/core.md:10 ../../site/api/core.md:13
#: ../../site/api/core.md:16 ../../site/api/core.md:19 ../../site/api/core.md:28
#: ../../site/api/core.md:34 ../../site/api/core.md:37 ../../site/api/core.md:40
msgid "Public Functions"
msgstr "公共函数"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid "Constructs a context from return and optional benchmark frames."
msgstr "根据收益帧和可选的基准帧构造上下文。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid ""
"The frames are stored as supplied; only the required double columns are "
"validated, and no sorting or index alignment is performed here."
msgstr "帧按传入原样存储；仅校验所需的 double 列，此处不进行排序或索引对齐。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../site/api/core.md
msgid "Throws"
msgstr "抛出"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid "Returns the cached performance summary."
msgstr "返回缓存的绩效摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid ""
"Core keys are Annual return, Cumulative returns, Annual volatility, Sharpe "
"ratio, Sortino ratio, Calmar ratio, Max drawdown, Historical value at risk "
"and Conditional value at risk. With a benchmark the result also contains "
"Alpha and Beta. Each metric is computed on first use and reused by later "
"calls."
msgstr ""
"核心键包括 Annual return、Cumulative returns、Annual volatility、Sharpe "
"ratio、Sortino ratio、Calmar ratio、Max drawdown、Historical value at risk 和 "
"Conditional value at risk。提供基准时结果还包含 Alpha 和 Beta。每个指标在首次使用时计算，并由后续调用复用。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:7
msgid "Returns how many times key has been computed and cached."
msgstr "返回 key 已被计算并缓存的次数。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:10
msgid "Error thrown when a strict batch fetch fails for one or more symbols."
msgstr "当严格批量获取对一个或多个标的失败时抛出的错误。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:10
msgid ""
"The payload uses category BatchFetchError and code fincore.data.batch_fetch."
" The message names the provider and the failed symbols in sorted order, and "
"the flat fields hold provider, symbols and error_count."
msgstr ""
"负载使用类别 BatchFetchError 和代码 "
"fincore.data.batch_fetch。消息按排序顺序列出提供方和失败的标的，扁平字段保存 provider、symbols 和 "
"error_count。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:10
msgid "Creates a batch fetch error."
msgstr "创建批量获取错误。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:10
msgid "Returns the provider that produced the failure."
msgstr "返回产生该失败的提供方。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:10
msgid "Returns the per-symbol error messages."
msgstr "返回每个标的的错误消息。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:10
msgid "Returns the frames that were fetched successfully."
msgstr "返回成功获取的帧。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Native provider interface for price data."
msgstr "价格数据的原生提供方接口。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid ""
"Live SDK/network subclasses are EXTERNAL_OPTIONAL; the interface, batch "
"orchestration, date validation and return conversion are native and offline-"
"testable with an injected provider."
msgstr "实时 SDK/网络子类为 EXTERNAL_OPTIONAL；接口、批量编排、日期校验和收益转换均为原生实现，并可在注入提供方的情况下离线测试。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Destroys the provider."
msgstr "销毁提供方。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Returns the provider's stable name."
msgstr "返回提供方的稳定名称。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Fetches price data for one symbol."
msgstr "获取一个标的的价格数据。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid ""
"Implementations define how start and end are interpreted; this interface "
"does not validate them. Exceptions derived from std::exception are recorded "
"per symbol by fetch_multiple()."
msgstr ""
"start 和 end 的解释方式由实现定义；此接口不校验它们。派生自 std::exception 的异常由 fetch_multiple() "
"按标的记录。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Returns provider-specific metadata for one symbol."
msgstr "返回一个标的的提供方特定元数据。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Returns the adjustment flag used when fetch_multiple() is not given one."
msgstr "返回未向 fetch_multiple() 提供调整标志时所使用的调整标志。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Fetches several symbols through fetch()."
msgstr "通过 fetch() 获取多个标的。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid ""
"The adjustment flag is adjust when supplied, otherwise "
"batch_adjust_default(). Every symbol is attempted. In non-strict mode a "
"failed symbol is stored as an empty frame and its message is discarded; in "
"strict mode the loop still attempts all symbols and then throws if any "
"failed. start and end are passed to fetch() unchanged."
msgstr ""
"提供时调整标志为 adjust，否则使用 "
"batch_adjust_default()。每个标的都会被尝试。非严格模式下失败的标的存为空帧并丢弃其消息；严格模式下循环仍会尝试所有标的，随后若任一失败则抛出。start"
" 和 end 原样传给 fetch()。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Converts a price column to period-over-period simple returns."
msgstr "将价格列转换为逐期简单收益率。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid ""
"column is used when present; otherwise the method falls back to \"Close\". "
"Consecutive pairs where either price is NaN are skipped. A zero previous "
"price with a nonzero current price yields signed infinity; zero over zero "
"yields NaN and is skipped. Fewer than two prices yield an empty result."
msgstr ""
"存在 column 时使用该列；否则方法回退到 \"Close\"。任一价格为 NaN "
"的相邻价格对被跳过。前一价格为零而当前价格非零时得到带符号的无穷大；零除以零得到 NaN 并被跳过。价格少于两个时返回空结果。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13 ../../site/api/core.md:16 ../../site/api/core.md:19
#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Public Static Functions"
msgstr "公共静态函数"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid "Parses and validates an ISO-8601 UTC date range."
msgstr "解析并校验 ISO-8601 UTC 日期范围。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:13
msgid ""
"Accepted forms are YYYY-MM-DD, optionally followed by T or a space and "
"HH:MM:SS with an optional . fraction of up to nine digits. Omitted time "
"components default to midnight. Values are interpreted as UTC; a trailing "
"timezone designator is not accepted."
msgstr ""
"接受的形式为 YYYY-MM-DD，可选后接 T 或空格以及 HH:MM:SS，并可选带最多九位数字的 . 小数部分。省略的时间分量默认为午夜。值按 "
"UTC 解释；不接受末尾的时区标识。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Immutable, content-addressed snapshot of fetched market data."
msgstr "已获取市场数据的不可变、内容寻址快照。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"The content digest is computed over a canonical native CSV (UTC-nanosecond "
"index plus columns in insertion order); it is a deterministic native "
"provenance digest, not a claim that Python/pandas CSV bytes are identical."
msgstr ""
"内容摘要基于规范的 native CSV（UTC 纳秒索引加上按插入顺序排列的列）计算；它是确定性的原生来源摘要，并不表示 Python/pandas "
"的 CSV 字节完全相同。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Creates an empty snapshot."
msgstr "创建空快照。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"The timezone defaults to \"UTC\" and the price adjustment to \"raw\"; the "
"remaining metadata and the frame are empty."
msgstr "时区默认为 \"UTC\"，价格调整默认为 \"raw\"；其余元数据和帧为空。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Creates a snapshot from explicit metadata and data."
msgstr "根据显式元数据和数据创建快照。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"Values are stored as supplied; no digest is computed and no consistency "
"check is performed."
msgstr "值按传入原样存储；不计算摘要，也不进行一致性检查。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns a defensive copy of the snapshot frame."
msgstr "返回快照帧的防御性副本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns a reference to the stored frame without copying."
msgstr "返回所存帧的引用，不进行复制。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the identity metadata of the snapshot."
msgstr "返回快照的身份元数据。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"The map holds provider, requested_start, requested_end, as_of, timezone and "
"price_adjustment; the digest and data are excluded."
msgstr ""
"该映射包含 provider、requested_start、requested_end、as_of、timezone 和 "
"price_adjustment；不包含摘要和数据。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns a JSON manifest describing the snapshot."
msgstr "返回描述快照的 JSON 清单。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"The object contains schema_version, provider, requested_start, "
"requested_end, as_of, timezone, price_adjustment and content_sha256; frame "
"data is not included."
msgstr ""
"该对象包含 "
"schema_version、provider、requested_start、requested_end、as_of、timezone、price_adjustment"
" 和 content_sha256；不包含帧数据。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the manifest as a flat string map."
msgstr "以扁平字符串映射返回清单。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"The same fields as to_manifest() are returned, with schema_version rendered "
"as a decimal string."
msgstr "返回与 to_manifest() 相同的字段，其中 schema_version 以十进制字符串表示。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the provider name."
msgstr "返回提供方名称。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the requested start date text."
msgstr "返回请求的开始日期文本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the requested end date text."
msgstr "返回请求的结束日期文本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the capture time text."
msgstr "返回采集时间文本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the timezone label."
msgstr "返回时区标签。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the price adjustment label."
msgstr "返回价格调整标签。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the content digest text."
msgstr "返回内容摘要文本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Returns the data snapshot schema version."
msgstr "返回数据快照的 schema 版本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid "Creates a snapshot and computes its content digest from frame."
msgstr "创建快照并根据 frame 计算其内容摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:16
msgid ""
"A defensive copy of frame is stored, and the digest is "
"dataframe_content_sha256() of that copy."
msgstr "存储 frame 的防御性副本，摘要为该副本的 dataframe_content_sha256()。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Exception type carrying a structured error_info payload."
msgstr "携带结构化 error_info 负载的异常类型。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid ""
"The std::runtime_error message is the error_info message, so what() returns "
"the same text."
msgstr "std::runtime_error 的消息即 error_info 的消息，因此 what() 返回相同文本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Subclassed by fincore::batch_fetch_error, fincore::research_error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Creates an exception from a structured payload."
msgstr "从结构化负载创建异常。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid ""
"Creates an exception with the default FincoreError category and "
"fincore.error code."
msgstr "创建使用默认 FincoreError 类别和 fincore.error 代码的异常。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Returns the structured error payload."
msgstr "返回结构化错误负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Returns the source exception class name."
msgstr "返回源异常类名。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Returns the stable dotted error code."
msgstr "返回稳定的点分错误代码。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Returns the flat error fields."
msgstr "返回扁平错误字段。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Returns the diagnostic report entries."
msgstr "返回诊断报告条目。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:19
msgid "Creates an exception from the flat dictionary form."
msgstr "从扁平字典形式创建异常。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:22
msgid "Invalid caller input, derived from std::invalid_argument."
msgstr "调用方输入无效，派生自 std::invalid_argument。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:22
msgid ""
"The type inherits the std::invalid_argument constructors. Calendar and "
"dataframe helpers such as utc_timestamp() and make_series() throw it for "
"rejected arguments."
msgstr ""
"该类型继承 std::invalid_argument 的构造函数。utc_timestamp() 和 make_series() 等日历与 "
"dataframe 辅助函数在参数被拒绝时抛出该异常。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:25
msgid "Optimization failure, derived from std::runtime_error."
msgstr "优化失败，派生自 std::runtime_error。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:25
msgid ""
"The type inherits the std::runtime_error constructors. Optimization routines"
" throw it for solver-level failures."
msgstr "该类型继承 std::runtime_error 的构造函数。优化例程在求解器级失败时抛出该异常。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:28
msgid "Computes trailing-window series for one or more rolling metrics."
msgstr "为一个或多个滚动指标计算尾随窗口序列。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:28
msgid ""
"The engine owns copies of the return and optional benchmark frames. Each "
"metric is evaluated over every complete window of window observations; rows "
"before the first complete window are omitted from the output."
msgstr "该引擎持有收益帧和可选基准帧的副本。每个指标在由 window 个观测构成的每个完整窗口上计算；首个完整窗口之前的行不会出现在输出中。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:28
msgid "Constructs an engine over return and optional benchmark frames."
msgstr "基于收益帧和可选基准帧构造引擎。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:28
msgid "Returns one trailing-window series per requested metric."
msgstr "为每个请求的指标返回一个尾随窗口序列。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:28
msgid ""
"The result maps each metric's enum name (mean_return, volatility, sharpe, "
"max_drawdown, beta) to a frame whose single returns column holds the metric "
"value at each complete window's final timestamp. Beta inputs are first "
"aligned on their common index, so its series can be shorter. An empty metric"
" list returns an empty map, and fewer than window available observations "
"yield empty series."
msgstr ""
"结果将每个指标的枚举名（mean_return、volatility、sharpe、max_drawdown、beta）映射到一个帧，其单个 "
"returns 列保存每个完整窗口最后时间戳处的指标值。Beta 输入先按其公共索引对齐，因此其序列可能更短。指标列表为空时返回空映射，可用观测少于 "
"window 时得到空序列。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:31
msgid "Availability record for one dependency."
msgstr "一个依赖项的可用性记录。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:31 ../../site/api/core.md:34 ../../site/api/core.md:37
#: ../../site/api/core.md:40
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:31
msgid "Dependency name used in error messages."
msgstr "错误消息中使用的依赖项名称。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:31
msgid "Whether the dependency is available."
msgstr "依赖项是否可用。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:31
msgid "Extra or feature label for the dependency."
msgstr "依赖项的 extra 或功能标签。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Native structured error payload."
msgstr "原生结构化错误负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid ""
"Python exception inheritance is not reproduced; the source class name is "
"preserved as category, with a stable code, message, flat fields and an "
"optional diagnostic report."
msgstr "不复制 Python 的异常继承关系；源类名保留为 category，并带有稳定的 code、message、扁平字段和可选的诊断报告。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Returns the flat dictionary form of this error."
msgstr "返回此错误的扁平字典形式。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid ""
"The result starts from fields and adds error_type, message, code when non-"
"empty, and one report.-prefixed key per report entry."
msgstr "结果以 fields 为基础，加上 error_type、message、非空的 code，以及每个报告条目对应的一个以 report. 为前缀的键。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid ""
"Returns a compact JSON object with category, code, message, fields and "
"report."
msgstr "返回包含 category、code、message、fields 和 report 的紧凑 JSON 对象。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "String values are JSON-escaped."
msgstr "字符串值按 JSON 转义。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Source exception class name, such as ValidationError."
msgstr "源异常类名，例如 ValidationError。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Stable dotted error code, such as fincore.validation."
msgstr "稳定的点分错误代码，例如 fincore.validation。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Human-readable error message."
msgstr "人类可读的错误消息。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Flat string fields such as param_name."
msgstr "扁平字符串字段，例如 param_name。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Diagnostic report entries; flattened with a report."
msgstr "诊断报告条目；扁平化时加上 report."

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "prefix by to_dict()."
msgstr "作为前缀，由 to_dict() 添加。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid "Builds an error payload from the flat dictionary form."
msgstr "从扁平字典形式构建错误负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:34
msgid ""
"error_type is required and becomes category. A non-empty code entry "
"overrides the default code formed by prefixing the category with fincore.; a"
" message entry becomes the message; report.-prefixed entries become report "
"entries and all other entries become flat fields."
msgstr ""
"error_type 为必需项，并成为 category。非空的 code 条目会覆盖通过给 category 加上 fincore. "
"前缀而形成的默认代码；message 条目成为消息；以 report. 为前缀的条目成为报告条目，其余所有条目成为扁平字段。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
msgid "Stable native operation descriptor."
msgstr "稳定的原生操作描述符。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
msgid ""
"The pinned Python domains declare an OperationSpec with an operation id, the"
" same capability id, a domain, determinism/RNG policy and provenance. Native"
" consumers need the same stable identity without Python callables, adapters "
"or placeholder implementations. This descriptor therefore carries "
"identity/metadata only; the owning native kernel remains the implementation."
msgstr ""
"锁定版本的 Python 各领域声明了 OperationSpec，包含操作 id、相同的能力 id、领域、确定性/RNG "
"策略和来源。原生使用方需要相同的稳定标识，但不使用 Python "
"可调用对象、适配器或占位实现。因此该描述符只承载标识/元数据；实际实现仍由所属的原生内核负责。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
msgid "Creates an empty descriptor."
msgstr "创建空描述符。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
msgid "All views are empty, deterministic is true and rng_policy is \"none\"."
msgstr "所有视图为空，deterministic 为 true，rng_policy 为 \"none\"。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
msgid "Creates a descriptor from an operation id."
msgstr "根据操作 id 创建描述符。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
msgid ""
"capability_id is set to id. domain and provenance_owner are the text before "
"the first dot, or the whole id when it has no dot; source_module is empty "
"when id has no dot, the whole id when it has exactly one dot, and otherwise "
"the text before the second dot."
msgstr ""
"capability_id 设为 id。domain 和 provenance_owner 为第一个点之前的文本，id 不含点时则为整个 "
"id；source_module 在 id 不含点时为空，恰好含一个点时等于整个 id，否则为第二个点之前的文本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:37
