msgstr "无风险利率为零时的年化夏普比率。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:43
msgid "Worst peak-to-trough drawdown in the window."
msgstr "窗口内最差的峰谷回撤。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:43
msgid "Unannualized beta against the aligned benchmark window."
msgstr "相对于已对齐基准窗口的未年化 beta。"

