#: ../../site/api/core.md:49
msgid "Returns two single-column frames restricted to their common timestamps."
msgstr "返回两个单列帧，仅保留它们共有的时间戳。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:49
msgid ""
"The result is an inner join on the timestamp index. Timestamps are taken "
"from left in its existing order, and values are matched against right by "
"timestamp; timestamps present in only one input are dropped."
msgstr "结果是在时间戳索引上的内连接。时间戳按 left 的现有顺序取自 left，值按时间戳与 right 匹配；仅出现在一个输入中的时间戳会被丢弃。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:52
msgid "Returns an AlignmentError payload via contextual_error()."
msgstr "通过 contextual_error() 返回 AlignmentError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:55
msgid "Returns all declared operations in domain order."
msgstr "按领域顺序返回所有已声明的操作。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:58
msgid "Returns the attribution operations in source order."
msgstr "按源顺序返回归因操作。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:61
msgid "Returns a canonical CSV rendering of frame."
msgstr "返回 frame 的规范 CSV 呈现。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:61
msgid ""
"The first line is index followed by the column names in insertion order; "
"each subsequent line holds the UTC-nanosecond index value and the column "
"values. Doubles use Python-compatible float formatting, except that NaN is "
"an empty field and infinities are inf or -inf; booleans are True or False; "
"strings are quoted only when needed, with embedded quotes doubled. Integral "
"columns are rendered as decimal integers. The output ends with a newline."
msgstr ""
"第一行为 index，后接按插入顺序排列的列名；其后每行保存 UTC 纳秒索引值和各列值。double 使用与 Python 兼容的浮点格式，但 NaN"
" 为空字段，无穷大表示为 inf 或 -inf；布尔值为 True 或 "
"False；字符串仅在需要时加引号，内嵌引号重复一次。整数列以十进制整数表示。输出以换行结尾。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:64
msgid "Throws when any listed dependency is unavailable."
msgstr "任一列出的依赖项不可用时抛出。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:64
msgid ""
"The error is a DependencyError whose dependency field lists every "
"unavailable name in input order, joined with \", \". The extra field is the "
"first non-empty extra label among the unavailable dependencies and is "
"omitted when none supplies one. Its message is Missing required "
"dependencies: followed by the names."
msgstr ""
"该错误为 DependencyError，其 dependency 字段按输入顺序列出所有不可用的名称，并以 \", \" 连接。extra "
"字段为不可用依赖项中第一个非空的 extra 标签，若都未提供则省略。其消息为 Missing required dependencies: "
"后接这些名称。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:67
msgid "Returns an error payload with operation context and code fincore.contract."
msgstr "返回带有操作上下文和代码 fincore.contract 的错误负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:67
msgid ""
"category is used verbatim. Optional context values are stored in fields "
"under operation_id, parameter, path and profile only when non-empty."
msgstr ""
"category 原样使用。可选的上下文值仅在非空时存入 fields 的 operation_id、parameter、path 和 profile "
"下。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:70
msgid "Returns a DataAlignmentError payload with code fincore.data_alignment."
msgstr "返回代码为 fincore.data_alignment 的 DataAlignmentError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:70
msgid ""
"Optional lengths are stored as decimal strings under returns_length and "
"factor_length."
msgstr "可选的长度以十进制字符串存入 returns_length 和 factor_length。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:73
msgid "Returns the data operations in source order."
msgstr "按源顺序返回数据操作。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:76
msgid "Returns the lowercase hexadecimal SHA-256 of canonical_dataframe_csv()."
msgstr "返回 canonical_dataframe_csv() 的小写十六进制 SHA-256。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:79
msgid "Returns a DependencyError payload with code fincore.dependency."
msgstr "返回代码为 fincore.dependency 的 DependencyError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:79
msgid "dependency and extra are stored in fields only when non-empty."
msgstr "dependency 和 extra 仅在非空时存入 fields。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:82
msgid "Returns value, or replace_with when value is NaN."
msgstr "返回 value；当 value 为 NaN 时返回 replace_with。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:85
msgid "Returns the factor analysis operations in source order."
msgstr "按源顺序返回因子分析操作。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:88
msgid ""
"Runs a numeric kernel and converts native numeric exceptions to "
"NumericalError."
msgstr "运行数值内核，并将原生数值异常转换为 NumericalError。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:88
msgid ""
"Existing fincore_error exceptions pass through unchanged. std::domain_error,"
" std::overflow_error, std::underflow_error, std::invalid_argument and other "
"std::runtime_error exceptions are rethrown as fincore_error payloads from "
"numerical_error() with the supplied operation label. The kernel result is "
"returned unchanged."
msgstr ""
"已有的 fincore_error "
"异常原样透传。std::domain_error、std::overflow_error、std::underflow_error、std::invalid_argument"
" 及其他 std::runtime_error 异常会以 numerical_error() 生成的 fincore_error "
"负载重新抛出，并带上所提供的 operation 标签。内核结果原样返回。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md
msgid "Template Parameters"
msgstr "模板参数"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:91
msgid "Returns an InputContractError payload via contextual_error()."
msgstr "通过 contextual_error() 返回 InputContractError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:94
msgid "Returns an InsufficientDataError payload with code fincore.insufficient_data."
msgstr "返回代码为 fincore.insufficient_data 的 InsufficientDataError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:94
msgid ""
"Optional lengths are stored as decimal strings under required_length and "
"actual_length."
msgstr "可选的长度以十进制字符串存入 required_length 和 actual_length。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:97
msgid "Returns an InvalidPeriodError payload for period."
msgstr "返回针对 period 的 InvalidPeriodError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:97
msgid ""
"The payload uses code fincore.invalid_period, lists the accepted periods "
"(daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, yearly) and stores period and "
"valid_periods in fields."
msgstr ""
"该负载使用代码 "
"fincore.invalid_period，列出可接受的周期（daily、weekly、monthly、quarterly、yearly），并将 "
"period 和 valid_periods 存入 fields。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:100
msgid "Returns a structured error payload built from the supplied components."
msgstr "返回由所提供的组成部分构建的结构化错误负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:100
msgid ""
"No validation or normalization is applied; fields and report are stored as "
"given."
msgstr "不进行任何校验或规范化；fields 和 report 按给定内容存储。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:103
