"The payload uses category RuntimeDiagnosticError, code "
"fincore.runtime.operation_resolution, runtime category resolution_failure, "
"an unknown operation_id: message followed by the identifier, and a "
"remediation that points at the operation catalog."
msgstr ""
"该负载使用类别 RuntimeDiagnosticError、代码 fincore.runtime.operation_resolution、运行时类别"
" resolution_failure、由 unknown operation_id: 后接标识符构成的消息，以及指向操作目录的修复建议。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:106
msgid "Returns a single-column frame built from an index and double values."
msgstr "返回由索引和 double 值构建的单列帧。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:106
msgid ""
"The column is loaded without NaN padding, so the index and column sizes "
