msgstr "返回代码为 fincore.runtime.diagnostic 的 RuntimeDiagnosticError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:145
msgid ""
"runtime_category is always stored in fields; operation_id, capability_id and"
" remediation are stored only when non-empty. details becomes the diagnostic "
"report."
msgstr ""
"runtime_category 始终存入 fields；operation_id、capability_id 和 remediation "
"仅在非空时存入。details 成为诊断报告。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:148
msgid ""
"Returns numerator / denominator, or default_value when the denominator is "
"zero."
msgstr "返回 numerator / denominator；当分母为零时返回 default_value。"

