msgstr "format 仅在非空时存入 fields。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:160
msgid "Returns the UTC Unix-epoch timestamp for a calendar date and time."
msgstr "返回日历日期和时间的 UTC Unix 纪元时间戳。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:160
