msgstr "返回代码为 fincore.validation 的 ValidationError 负载。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:166
msgid "param_name and value are stored in fields only when non-empty."
msgstr "param_name 和 value 仅在非空时存入 fields。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:169
msgid "Returns the pinned oracle version as an owning-friendly view."
msgstr "以便于持有的视图返回锁定的 oracle 版本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:172
