msgstr "保留自当前 C4 基线的原生库版本。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:193
msgid ""
"The pinned Python oracle version is exposed separately below so installed-"
"consumer metadata checks can compare against the frozen Python pin without "
"pretending the native ABI version changed. Native major version."
msgstr ""
"锁定的 Python oracle 版本在下方单独暴露，以便已安装使用方的元数据检查可以与冻结的 Python 锁定版本比较，而无需假装原生 ABI "
"版本发生了变化。原生主版本号。"

#: ../../site/api/core.md:196
